              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "en premier lieu — \"in the first place, firstly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "En premier lieu, il a parlé de sa famille. In the first place, he talked about his family."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; it orders the points of a speech or a report, often followed by en second lieu."
            }
          ]
        },
